{"seq":1,"slug":"onboarding-metrics-ttv","title":"入职度量与 Time-to-Value","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/engineering-onboarding-enablement/measurement/onboarding-metrics-ttv","wordCount":1536,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"入职度量与-time-to-value\">入职度量与 Time-to-Value</h1><p>大多数工程组织在招聘上投入 5-15% 的人力预算，在入职后 90 天的体验上投入约 0%。原因是<strong>没人拥有入职成效这个指标</strong>——招聘团队看 time-to-fill，Engineering Manager 看团队产出，中间那段「从入职到持续独立贡献」没有 owner。当没人衡量它，就没人投资改善它。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>Time-to-Value（TTV）：</strong> 从入职日到新人产生持续独立贡献的天数——入职成效的核心指标</li>\n<li><strong>先行指标 vs 滞后指标：</strong> 先行指标（Day 5 内可发现问题）允许早期干预，滞后指标衡量最终结果</li>\n<li><strong>红旗规则：</strong> 预定义的告警信号及对应干预动作，避免等到 Day 90 才发现入职失败</li>\n<li><strong>Cohort 分析：</strong> 跨入职批次的纵向比较，识别哪些流程变更真正有效</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"time-to-value-ttv-入职的核心指标\">Time-to-Value（TTV）：入职的核心指标</h2><p>Time-to-Value 是从入职日到新人产生<strong>持续独立贡献</strong>的天数。它不是 time-to-first-commit（那只是最低门槛），而是新人达到团队平均交付节奏的时间点。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>持续独立贡献</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>入职日</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">TTV = T_{\\text{持续独立贡献}} - T_{\\text{入职日}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">持续独立贡献</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">入职日</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>行业基准（2026 年数据）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工程师级别</th>\n<th>结构化入职 TTV</th>\n<th>无结构入职 TTV</th>\n<th>差距</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Junior</td>\n<td>90-120 天</td>\n<td>150-180 天</td>\n<td>+60%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mid-level</td>\n<td>60-90 天</td>\n<td>90-150 天</td>\n<td>+67%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Senior</td>\n<td>45-75 天</td>\n<td>90-120 天</td>\n<td>+60%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Staff+</td>\n<td>60-90 天（聚焦上下文）</td>\n<td>120-180 天</td>\n<td>+100%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"先行指标-vs-滞后指标\">先行指标 vs 滞后指标</h2><p>入职度量需要区分先行指标（early signals）和滞后指标（outcomes）。先行指标允许<strong>在 Day 15 就发现问题</strong>，而非等到 Day 90 才意识到入职失败。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph Leading[先行指标 - 可早期干预]&#10;        A[Time-to-first-commit&lt;br/&gt;目标: Day 3-5]&#10;        B[每周提问数&lt;br/&gt;初期 10+ 递减]&#10;        C[文档贡献数&lt;br/&gt;Day 30 前 ≥2]&#10;        D[会议参与度&lt;br/&gt;递增趋势]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Lagging[滞后指标 - 最终结果]&#10;        E[Time-to-solo-project&lt;br/&gt;目标: Week 6-8]&#10;        F[Manager 信心分&lt;br/&gt;Day 60 ≥8/10]&#10;        G[新人满意度&lt;br/&gt;Day 90 ≥8/10]&#10;        H[Code review 质量&lt;br/&gt;Day 60 达到 peer 水平]&#10;    end&#10;    Leading --&gt; Lagging\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph Leading[先行指标 - 可早期干预]\n        A[Time-to-first-commit&lt;br/&gt;目标: Day 3-5]\n        B[每周提问数&lt;br/&gt;初期 10+ 递减]\n        C[文档贡献数&lt;br/&gt;Day 30 前 ≥2]\n        D[会议参与度&lt;br/&gt;递增趋势]\n    end\n    subgraph Lagging[滞后指标 - 最终结果]\n        E[Time-to-solo-project&lt;br/&gt;目标: Week 6-8]\n        F[Manager 信心分&lt;br/&gt;Day 60 ≥8/10]\n        G[新人满意度&lt;br/&gt;Day 90 ≥8/10]\n        H[Code review 质量&lt;br/&gt;Day 60 达到 peer 水平]\n    end\n    Leading --&gt; Lagging</pre><h3 id=\"先行指标详解\">先行指标详解</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>目标</th>\n<th>为什么重要</th>\n<th>红旗信号</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Time-to-first-commit</td>\n<td>Day 3-5</td>\n<td>环境就绪的证明</td>\n<td>Day 5 无 commit → 环境/访问阻塞</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Time-to-first-merged-PR</td>\n<td>Week 1</td>\n<td>能走完开发闭环</td>\n<td>Week 2 无 PR → 任务定义问题</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>每周提问数</td>\n<td>初期高，逐渐下降</td>\n<td>参与度信号</td>\n<td>Week 1 后骤降 → 脱离或恐惧</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>文档贡献</td>\n<td>Day 30 前 ≥2</td>\n<td>主动学习信号</td>\n<td>0 贡献 → 被动接收模式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>会议发言</td>\n<td>递增趋势</td>\n<td>融入度信号</td>\n<td>持续沉默 → 可能不理解上下文</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"滞后指标详解\">滞后指标详解</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>目标</th>\n<th>如何衡量</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Time-to-solo-project</td>\n<td>Week 6-8</td>\n<td>第一次无 oversight 完成完整特性的时间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Manager 信心评分</td>\n<td>Day 60 ≥8/10</td>\n<td>Manager 主观评估：「你信任这个人独立工作吗？」</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>新人满意度 NPS</td>\n<td>Day 90 ≥8/10</td>\n<td>匿名 survey</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Code review 质量</td>\n<td>Day 60 peer-level</td>\n<td>Review comment 被采纳率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Incident 响应能力</td>\n<td>Day 90 可做 backup</td>\n<td>已完成 2 轮 on-call shadow</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"红旗规则-何时干预\">红旗规则：何时干预</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>红旗信号</th>\n<th>时间点</th>\n<th>干预动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Day 5 无 commit</td>\n<td>Day 5</td>\n<td>立即排查环境/访问阻塞</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Week 1 后提问骤降</td>\n<td>Day 10</td>\n<td>Buddy 主动发起深度 1:1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>同一问题重复出现</td>\n<td>任何时候</td>\n<td>文档缺口，需要补文档</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Manager 信心 &lt;6/10</td>\n<td>Day 30</td>\n<td>重新对齐期望，调整任务难度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>新人满意度 &lt;7/10</td>\n<td>任何 checkpoint</td>\n<td>需要干预：换 buddy / 调任务 / 1:1 对话</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"cohort-分析-跨代际比较\">Cohort 分析：跨代际比较</h2><p>单个新人的指标有噪声——真正有价值的是<strong>Cohort 分析</strong>：比较不同月份入职的一批人，识别哪些流程变更真正有效。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mtext>TTV</mtext><mtext>Cohort</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>V</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">‾</mo></mover><mtext>本月</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>V</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">‾</mo></mover><mtext>上月</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta \\text{TTV}_{\\text{Cohort}} = \\overline{TTV}_{\\text{本月}} - \\overline{TTV}_{\\text{上月}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">TTV</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">Cohort</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord overline\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8833em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.8033em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"overline-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">本月</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord overline\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8833em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.8033em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"overline-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">上月</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>比较维度</th>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>洞察</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>时间维度</td>\n<td>本月 cohort vs 上月 cohort</td>\n<td>流程改进是否有效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>背景维度</td>\n<td>同批内 Junior vs Senior</td>\n<td>不同级别的节奏差异</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模式维度</td>\n<td>有 buddy vs 无 buddy</td>\n<td>buddy 系统的增量价值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>位置维度</td>\n<td>远程 vs 混合 vs 现场</td>\n<td>远程入职的额外成本</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"入职度量仪表盘设计\">入职度量仪表盘设计</h2><p>一个实用的入职度量仪表盘应包含：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>板块</th>\n<th>内容</th>\n<th>更新频率</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>个人进度</td>\n<td>当前新人的 30-60-90 里程碑达标状态</td>\n<td>实时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>先行指标</td>\n<td>本周的 commit 数、PR 数、meeting 参与</td>\n<td>每周</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cohort 趋势</td>\n<td>近 6 个月各 cohort 的 TTV 趋势线</td>\n<td>每月</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>红旗告警</td>\n<td>触发红旗规则的新人列表</td>\n<td>实时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>流程实验</td>\n<td>当前 A/B 测试的入职流程变更及结果</td>\n<td>每月</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"成本模型-量化入职投资的-roi\">成本模型：量化入职投资的 ROI</h2><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>入职 ROI</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mtext>TTV 缩短带来的生产力增益</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>入职项目投入</mtext></mrow><mtext>入职项目投入</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{入职 ROI} = \\frac{\\text{TTV 缩短带来的生产力增益} - \\text{入职项目投入}}{\\text{入职项目投入}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">入职</span><span class=\"mord\"> ROI</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">入职项目投入</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">TTV </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">缩短带来的生产力增益</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">入职项目投入</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>具体计算：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>项目</th>\n<th>数值（示例）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>工程师月薪成本（含福利）</td>\n<td>$15,000/月</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无结构入职 TTV</td>\n<td>120 天</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>有结构入职 TTV</td>\n<td>60 天</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TTV 缩短</td>\n<td>60 天 = 2 个月</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>每人节省</td>\n<td>$30,000</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>入职项目投入（buddy 10h/月 × 3月 + 工具 + 文档维护）</td>\n<td>~$5,000</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>每人 ROI</strong></td>\n<td><strong>500%</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>对一个每年入职 10 人的团队，结构化入职每年节省约 $250,000 的生产力浪费。这解释了为什么入职是<strong>投资回报最高的工程管理改进</strong>之一。</p>\n<h2 id=\"度量的陷阱-避免-goodhart-s-law\">度量的陷阱：避免 Goodhart&#39;s Law</h2><p>当一个指标变成目标时，它就不再是好的指标。常见陷阱：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>不要把 time-to-first-commit 当终极指标：</strong> 如果为了「Day 1 就有 commit」而让新人改 README typo，那个 commit 毫无意义</li>\n<li><strong>不要把提问数当绝对值追：</strong> 高提问数可能意味着文档太差而非新人积极</li>\n<li><strong>不要让新人知道自己被哪些指标「监控」：</strong> 这会改变行为——他们会为了指标而非学习去行动</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>指标的正确用法是诊断工具，不是考核工具。</strong> 用它来发现流程问题（「为什么这批人 Day 5 都没 commit？」），而非评判个人（「这个人 Day 5 还没 commit，是不是不行？」）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>入职度量的核心是让「从入职到独立贡献」这段旅程可见、可衡量、可干预。TTV 是终极指标，先行指标让问题在 Day 15 就暴露，红旗规则确保暴露后有行动。Cohort 分析将个体噪声过滤为趋势信号。最重要的原则：指标是诊断工具而非考核工具——用它改善流程，而非评判个人。</p>\n<p>关于如何收集定性反馈来补充这些定量指标，详见 <a href=\"feedback-iteration\">反馈收集与迭代</a>；关于入职框架本身的设计，参见 <a href=\"../program-design/onboarding-framework\">入职框架与 30-60-90 计划</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"入职度量与 Time-to-Value","id":"入职度量与-time-to-value"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Time-to-Value（TTV）：入职的核心指标","id":"time-to-value-ttv-入职的核心指标"},{"level":2,"text":"先行指标 vs 滞后指标","id":"先行指标-vs-滞后指标"},{"level":3,"text":"先行指标详解","id":"先行指标详解"},{"level":3,"text":"滞后指标详解","id":"滞后指标详解"},{"level":2,"text":"红旗规则：何时干预","id":"红旗规则-何时干预"},{"level":2,"text":"Cohort 分析：跨代际比较","id":"cohort-分析-跨代际比较"},{"level":2,"text":"入职度量仪表盘设计","id":"入职度量仪表盘设计"},{"level":2,"text":"成本模型：量化入职投资的 ROI","id":"成本模型-量化入职投资的-roi"},{"level":2,"text":"度量的陷阱：避免 Goodhart's Law","id":"度量的陷阱-避免-goodhart-s-law"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"导师与伙伴体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/engineering-onboarding-enablement/learning-paths/mentoring-buddy-system"},"next":{"title":"反馈收集与迭代","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/engineering-onboarding-enablement/measurement/feedback-iteration"}}